{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06093","headline":"清如玉壶冰 · 王维","name":"清如玉壶冰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉壶何用好，偏许素冰居。\n未共销丹日，还同照绮疏。\n抱明中不隐，含净外疑虚。\n气似庭霜积，光言砌月余。\n晓凌飞鹊镜，宵暎聚萤书。\n若向夫君比，清心尚不如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06093.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06093","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}